@startuml
autonumber
actor "Người dùng" as User
participant "DeckDetailScreen" as UI
participant "ConfirmDialog" as Dialog
participant "DeckProvider" as Provider
participant "Deck" as Model
participant "DeckRepository" as Repo
participant "SharedPreferences" as Prefs

User -> UI: Vuốt Dismissible để xóa từ / Nhấn nút xóa
UI -> Dialog: Hiển thị showConfirmDeleteDialog xác nhận
User -> Dialog: Xác nhận đồng ý xóa
Dialog -> Provider: deleteWord(deckId, wordId)
Provider -> Model: Deck.removeWord(wordId)
Provider -> Repo: saveDecks(decks)
Repo -> Prefs: setString('decks_v1', jsonEncode)
Prefs --> Repo: Lưu thành công
Repo --> Provider: Hoàn tất
Provider --> Provider: notifyListeners()
Provider --> UI: Xóa từ khỏi UI & Hiển thị SnackBar (word_deleted)
@enduml